    },
    {
      "id": "F2",
      "claim": "Gateway snapshot fixtures passed for default denial, key and project scope, unsupported credential kinds and a usable direct connection. The surviving project retained access to its shared fixture provider after a different disabled project was removed and the gateway restarted.",
